<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to raise public sector wages - report.</title>
<headline>Brazil to raise public sector wages - report.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government will raise public sector wages in January 1997, Jornal do Brasil newspaper reported.</p>
<p>There was no immediate comment from the Finance Ministry but Jornal do Brasil said the political decision had already been made.</p>
<p>It said the level of the increase had not yet been set, but that it would have to be lower than the expected increase in tax receipts in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom, 5511 248 5415.</p>
</text>
